@heydittoai V2 is live. The real Ai technological breakthrough is not just another iteration of a legacy model—it’s the @heydittoai ability to fix AI-amnesia with a persistent, durable memory layer. 

One shared memory covers your chats, files, and project context across tools like Claude, Cursor, and Codex so you never start from zero again ; one umbrella at https://t.co/598bkVX0sO .

You can also find its CEO  Peyton Spencer @peytonspencer  and its CTO Omar Barazanji at @omarzanji right here on @X as well.
